NAME
       du - estimate file space usage

SYNOPSIS
       du [-s] [-h] [path...]

DESCRIPTION
       Walks each PATH and reports how much space its files occupy.
       With no PATH the current directory is used.

OPTIONS
       -s     print only a total for each argument
       -h     print sizes as K, M, G instead of bytes

EXAMPLES
       du -sh /usr/share

SEE ALSO
       df(1), ls(1)
